{
  "format": 1,
  "name": "audio_tuning_unclamped",
  "spec": [
    "audio 16.19",
    "audio 10.8"
  ],
  "description": "_ReadTuningValues (0x004F9250) reads 0x6A946A50, 0xAABAA0D3, 0x0A946A57 and 0x4A946A5D from the one exemplar 0x6534284A/0xCA25875D/0x6A359C5C and applies no clamping, defaulting to 3, 10 and 30 when the read fails and logging the failure.",
  "steps": [
